{\plain {\b bessel.mcd}{ to plot some Bessel
 functions using MathCAD's built in Bessel
 function. We are interested in fairly small
 }{\f1 b}{, say < 10 or so. As we will now
 see empirically, this implies that only
 n over roughly the same range will be of
 interest.\par \par Recall that, for a single
 sinusoidal phase modulation, the spectrum
 (FT) of the phase modulated (PM) waveform
 had a Fourier series expansion in harmonics
 of the frequency of the phase modulation,
 with coeficients given by J}{\fs16 \dn6 
n}{(}{\f1 b}{).}}
}
